@startuml
title Figure 9(a). Root Tenant and Organization Boundaries
top to bottom direction

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam TitleFontSize 18
skinparam shadowing false

rectangle "Tenant A\nroot_organization_id = A" as TenantA {
  rectangle "University A\nRoot organization" as A
  rectangle "Faculty A1" as A1
  rectangle "Department A1.1" as A11
  rectangle "Club A2" as A2

  A -down-> A1 : parent
  A1 -down-> A11 : parent
  A -down-> A2 : parent
}

rectangle "Tenant B\nroot_organization_id = B" as TenantB {
  rectangle "University B\nRoot organization" as B
  rectangle "Faculty B1" as B1

  B -down-> B1 : parent
}

TenantA -[hidden]down- TenantB

note bottom
Every parent and child organization must have the same
root_organization_id. Relationships cannot cross tenants.
end note
@enduml
